{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現，法華；未，\n涅槃。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音句，\n驚悲也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三處謂內心、內色、外色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音迷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音錯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即能\n\n造心性，本具三千名造。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所造之事，三世攝盡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嫌人不曉，更細陳之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並指心之所造。經云：一切\n唯心造。論云：唯是一心作。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從無始至成佛，所造諸業，\n所感依正，不出善惡大小。此之四類，三世迭造，不出三千。所以一家示能造心具三千性，正由此也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且如同業所感人界依正，復由現在妄心分別，偏計不同。只此偏計，名為造現。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋成逐境心變也。義例云：當知一切由心\n分別諸法，何曾自謂同異？占察云：心生法生，心滅法滅。六道謂有，二乘謂空，菩薩可見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一官，喻心性一官。不同，喻妄計差別。\n是畏，如三途苦。是愛，如人天樂。是親，如菩薩入生死。是冤，如二乘出三界。圓人了達心性無差，取捨都泯，如了\n畏愛等別，只是一官。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即已證心性，稱物施為，現土現身，示生示\n滅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "變心，即向逐境心變也。以妄想故，逐於聖人，融通依正，而\n生殊見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此總示生佛無差，不出一家唯觀心性之意。眾生由\n心性具三千，故能徧造徧計。聖人由心性具三千，故能現土現身。如清濁二水，並由濕體無差，具波性故，方能\n為波。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既事境全由理變，是故但觀理具三千，則全事是理。如波\n浪全由水成，是故但觀水具波性，則全波是水。一家點示唯觀心性，意在此矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破即空，立即假，法界即中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "權，謂聖人變化所造。\n實，謂現造於現等。今但觀能造心性，本具三千，三無差別。任運攝其事造，以全所造事，是能造心性故。如觀能\n造之水，任連攝得所造之波，以全所造波，是能造水濕故。所以今論唯示剎那能造心中，本具三千，則所造瓦\n石，有佛理矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二句即共造\n依報也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二句即別造正報也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上涅槃疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古人非但別立頓頓，兼謂事觀可修一句\n者，如十二部觀云：觀心空假中，名長行直說等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五陰世間"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國土世間"}
